- 1.1.1/1.1.1/9.1.x  Study S003 — h5i (h5i-dev/h5i), study record
- 1.1.1/1.1.1/9.2.x  Study S003 — synthesis and open questions
- 1.1.1/1.1.1/10.1.x  Paper 006 — Skeleton Coding (arXiv:2610.38214), delta record
- 1.1.1/1.1.1/10.2.x  Paper 006 — synthesis and open questions
