- 1.1.1/1.1.1/1.3.x  FOUNDATIONS — level-zero definitions (rule 9);
  Defined Words register from 1.3.46 on (rule 10)
- x.3.1 in each paper chapter: standoff references (rule 9)
Restructuring log (rule 8): PASS #1 executed with Paper 005
(2026-11-06, every-5-papers trigger): 39 concepts reviewed, 0 merges,
