New from Paper 005:
Q15. Classification of the fake quadrics: are Akhmedov's (3,3) and
  (2,4) families two by two non-diffeomorphic exactly by their |H_1|
  orders, and do the closed sums' full handle diagrams (announced
  follow-up with Akbulut and Yildiz) reveal further integral
